cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "sapid" in publications use:'
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
title: 'sapid: A Strategy to Analyze Plant Extracts Taste In Depth'
version: 0.0.0.9002
abstract: Provides the infrastructure to implement a Strategy to Analyze Plant Extracts
  Taste In Depth (SAPID) by combining sensory panel profiling, projective napping,
  and Ascending Forced Choice (AFC) threshold testing with untargeted LC-MS feature
  tables, Charged Aerosol Detection (CAD) semi-quantification, taxonomically informed
  metabolite annotations (TIMA), and 1D proton NMR spectral clustering.
